          <h2
            class="MuiTypography-h2 MuiTypography-root css-XXXX-MuiTypography-root"
          >
            Positional Variant Notation in GraphKB
          </h2>
          <p
            class="MuiTypography-body1 MuiTypography-root css-XXXX-MuiTypography-root"
          >
            Positional variants in GraphKB use notation that is an extended form of 
            <a
              href="https://varnomen.hgvs.org/"
            >
              HGVS
            </a>
            . The traditional HGVS notation has been extended to support additional types and coordinate systems (ex. cytoband positions, exon numbers, etc.). The parser is implemented as a separate node package, further documentation on the parser and the notation it supports can be found with the 
            <a
              href="https://github.com/bcgsc/pori_graphkb_parser"
            >
              repository
            </a>
             for that package
          </p>
          <p
            class="MuiTypography-body1 MuiTypography-root css-XXXX-MuiTypography-root"
          >
            You can test out the parser below to see how it processes notation and to check if certain notation is valid
          </p>
